      "description": "한 줄 = 카테고리 하나. 선택 칩은 Sky.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-filter\"><span class=\"ds-filter-label\">종목</span><div class=\"ds-filter-opts\"><button class=\"ds-chip ds-chip-on\">에페</button><button class=\"ds-chip\">플뢰레</button><button class=\"ds-chip\">사브르</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, 'Malgun Gothic', system-ui, sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;} .ds-filter-label{width:48px;flex-shrink:0;padding-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:#8b9ab0;} .ds-filter-opts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;} .ds-chip{font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, 'Malgun Gothic', system-ui, sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;border:none;border-radius:4px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:14px;background:#121e2c;color:#8b9ab0;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s;} .ds-chip:hover{color:#e7edf5;} .ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0ca4e1;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-chip-on,.ds-chip-on:hover{background:#0ca4e1;color:#04121d;font-weight:600;}"
